-20260218-193621.png", "id": "1660094095012543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620429_1660094098345876_692028860291966484_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YbS8HQ8kxCYQ7kNvwE9oDpu&_nc_oc=AdpXf4eYpwspPxnp3QB-_QoUi6SUv7wPpWLoRo2ChqYaVHe89zvkxfCVWtxRj768W-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7IQXff3BThLYzBDQTy9fZ5r-gxz-OuELWDEjHTyKmgIA&oe=6A00926C"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.SurgicalTech-20260218-193650.png", "id": "1315478683751839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1315478687085172_2962157859596789382_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l0XFPswKtBoQ7kNvwGuvQ41&_nc_oc=Ado3UEuQDosI_ysRPTZ3E8u3Nu1YkgsuZSoa8eZQodNpmhnAM6_kXZEspZjA-Lbjw1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7yQzeFNh8Aimconu2fojGOgtJXbK-T9Tw43xGVQjI7dA&oe=6A00A683"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.SurgicalTech-20260218-193607.png", "id": "1732688774377919", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617831_1732688777711252_6296439795471439537_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0cjI_-XibEoQ7kNvwGtVPTn&_nc_oc=AdqpQ_kQMELGLIN-a697k2lU2c1W26gsHAIr2md81_qdINTIdlkJTTTvURKLfgIijaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5u9K-LHSKDdh1NBBI0mIPubPJCf0rpVZdDE5cll4wiZQ&oe=6A0070EF"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.SurgicalTech-20260218-193554.png", "id": "876512045220380", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_876512048553713_133527929692827975_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ZAnnFUA1ycQ7kNvwFL6OOV&_nc_oc=AdraHexsx6VgSojTaWAAv3k6rHJGibVzhbUAdEoR0zzvCj0bWCggprWnwDsUkkYKs34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Y8FBCs6-Ju_COewq8SilXZQ2p72NgHZp5exwZqmfGTA&oe=6A009218"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Surgical Technology", "keywords": ["Surgical", "tech", "immerselearn", "VR", "training"], "long_description": "Short Description (\u2264500 characters):\nSurgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on practice in surgical procedures, instrument handling, sterile techniques, and operating room protocols within a realistic virtual environment.\n\nLong Description (\u22641000 characters):\nSurgical Technology is part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program and is accessible only to students enrolled in the program. This immersive VR simulation delivers realistic, hands-on training in essential surgical technology skills and operating room procedures. Learners can practice sterile techniques, surgical instrument identification and handling, operating room preparation, and workflow coordination in a safe, interactive environment. Designed to align with industry and educational standards, the app helps students strengthen technical accuracy, safety compliance, and confidence before entering real-world clinical settings. Surgical Technology provides a risk-free space for developing critical perioperative skills and improving procedural knowledge through experiential learning. \n\nAccess to this application is restricted to students enrolled in the certification program for their hands-on training.", "short_description": "Surgical Technology is a VR training app developed as part of the Immerse Learn Surgical Technology Certification Program. Available exclusively to enrolled students, it provides hands-on practice in surgical procedures, instrument handling, sterile techniques, and operating room protocols within a realistic virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": 